OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to reinforce WW2 shelter
OL,4,Aunder playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuildford Borough Council is seeking
OL,7,Fplanning permission to carry out
OL,8,Fremedial work to reinforce a
OL,9,F"structurally unstable" World War Two
OL,10,Fair raid shelter.
OL,12,FThe wartime bunker, which sits
OL,13,Funderground beneath a cordoned-off area
OL,14,Fof Foxenden Quarry Playground, has now
OL,15,Ffallen into a state of disrepair, the
OL,16,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,17,Fsaid., external
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32602
