OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1787329553
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to reinforce WW2 shelter
OL,4,Aunder playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf the work is approved, secure fencing
OL,7,Fwill be placed around the work area,
OL,8,Fand a section of the playground will be
OL,9,Ftemporarily closed, the local authority
OL,10,Fsays.
OL,12,F"These measures are necessary to enable
OL,13,Fthe works to be completed safely,"
OL,14,Fcouncillor Phil Bellamy said. "Every
OL,15,Feffort will be made to keep disruption
OL,16,Fto playground users to a minimum."
